        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Dies Irae, Mad Stalker: Full Metal Force\n- Companies: Light, A.C.G.T\n- People: Keishi Yonao\n- Topics: TV anime adaptations, video game music\n\nFacts:\n- In 2017, the TV anime adaptation \"Dies Irae\" was planned for broadcast.\n- A.C.G.T animated the anime \"Dies Irae.\"\n- The anime \"Dies Irae\" is an adaptation of Light's video game of the same name.\n- Keishi Yonao is associated with the award-winning title \"Dies irae - Also sprach Zarathustra -.\"\n- Keishi Yonao composed the music for \"Mad Stalker: Full Metal Force.\"",
